ring you back together!", "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "175575705", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024146419", "personaname": "DampMoney", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198024146419/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1476, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 408, "last_played": 1733092020, "avatar": "62b40357c3cf2b9db0dcf975e75eb4718ba4127e"}, "language": "english", "review": "The fact that this game doesn't support more than 2 players ruined this game. I have asked for a return. For starters, the steam page doesn't do a good job of informing that only 2 can play coop (unlike almost every other rogue-like in existence.) This might have been the best rogue like i have ever played, the game is smooth as silk and fun, and interesting, and quirky. But honestly the fact that the developers quoted \"balance\" as the reason for the limitation in players is laughable. YOU control the balance. I understand there are development concerns, but it seem like you need to put your ear to the earth and understand what people want out of rogue-likes. Or give us mod support and I'll do your job for you....", "timestamp_created": 1727043701, "timestamp_updated": 1727043701, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.430287420749664307", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "175574637", "author": {"steamid": "76561199536029511", "personaname": "Straywonderer76", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199536029511/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 50012, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 4, "playtime_at_review": 22055, "last_played": 1789915008, "avat